Drop full-resolution originals in this directory.

Nothing here is committed to git — only the optimized derivatives the pipeline
writes to public/photos/. Keep your own backup of these files.

Subdirectories become groups:

    photos/originals/almaty/DSC_0142.jpg   -> group "almaty"
    photos/originals/DSC_0198.jpg          -> group "unsorted"

Then run:  python tools/build_photos.py
